export anchor ComicBookStyle:
    number: 38
    screen: TaskBoard
    name: Comic book
    idea: The board as a comic page, with inked panels on white gutters, halftone dot skies, task cards spoken in speech bubbles and a starburst that shouts what is overdue.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #fffdf5, the page and gutters
        ink: #111111, outlines, text and points chips
        yellow: #ffd60a, the logo panel, title fill and burst fill
        caption: #ffe98a, caption boxes and column titles
        red: #d1221d, the Add task button, the At risk banner and the overdue bubble outline
        blue: #1858c4, focus and sound effects
        yellowDots: #fff6c2, the To do panel with #f2c94c dots
        roseDots: #ffe4e1, the In progress panel with #f4a8a0 dots
        skyDots: #e6f0ff, the Review panel and the filter panel with #a9c8f5 dots
        mintDots: #e3f6e3, the Done panel with #9fd59f dots
        grey: #4a4a4a, placeholders and small notes
    type:
        Headings in Impact, Haettenschweiler, Arial Narrow Bold, Franklin
        Gothic Bold, Arial Black, sans-serif, always uppercase. Lettering
        in Comic Sans MS, Comic Neue, Chalkboard SE, Trebuchet MS,
        sans-serif. The title is 64px Impact in yellow with a 3px ink
        stroke and a 4px solid ink drop. Column titles are 20px Impact,
        card titles 15px bold uppercase lettering, meta 13px lettering,
        captions 13px bold uppercase and points 15px Impact.
    layout:
        A masthead row of three panels, a yellow Brightwork logo panel, a
        dotted Task board panel and a panel with Mara Okafor and her face
        circle. A wide title panel with radiating speed lines, a Meanwhile,
        on the board caption box in the corner, the title and a tilted red
        At risk banner. A dotted filter panel with a Filters caption, round
        ink-outlined dropdowns for Assignee, Label and Due, the Search tasks
        field and the red Add task button with a decorative POW above it.
        Four panels on 12px gutters, each with its title in a caption box
        hanging from the top left corner with a black count circle. Each
        task is a white speech bubble with a tail pointing down to its
        speaker row, a face circle with initials, the name in a small boxed
        label and a black points chip. Below 1080px two columns, below 640px
        one, and the POW and middle masthead panel hide.
    spacing: 12px gutters between every panel, 26px between bubbles to fit tails and speakers, 14 to 28px panel padding.
    density: Medium. One bubble and one speaker per task.
    corners: Square panels, captions and buttons, 26px speech bubbles, 20px fields and round faces.
    borders: 4px ink on panels and buttons, 3px on bubbles, captions and fields. The overdue bubble turns to a 4px red outline.
    shadows: None on boxes. Only the title lettering gets a solid 4px ink drop.
    icons:
        Heavy 2.6 stroke line glyphs at text size. Overdue is a jagged
        yellow starburst outlined in ink above the bubble, with a triangle
        and the word Overdue in dark red. Done is an ink tag with a tick and
        the word Done. Sound words such as POW are decoration only and
        hidden from screen readers.
    focus: A 4px blue outline offset 3px. A focused field turns its border blue with a 3px blue ring and a pale yellow halo.
    tone: Comic narration in captions, such as Meanwhile, on the board, while task text stays plain in caps lettering.
